  <Properties>
    <Name>UI - Diary</Name>
    <Teaser>Displays key events as a tooltip on the top panel date/turn indicators</Teaser>
    <Description>Displays a summary of key events as a tooltip on the date and turn indicators in the top panel

Click the date or turn indicators to change the entries displayed</Description>
